      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>hostname is the desired custom domain under which console will be available.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>secret</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>secret points to secret in the openshift-config namespace that contains custom certificate and key and needs to be created manually by the cluster admin. Referenced Secret is required to contain following key value pairs: - "tls.crt" - to specifies custom certificate - "tls.key" - to specifies private key of the custom certificate If the custom hostname uses the default routing suffix of the cluster, the Secret specification for a serving certificate will not be needed.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
